<!-- 智慧配餐（CR-028）· 目标设置 → 一周三餐 → 营养达成 → 食材清单 → 预约助餐 -->
<view class="page page--fbar">
  <!-- 设置页 -->
  <block wx:if="{{!ready}}">
    <view class="pgh pgh--green" style="padding-top:{{statusBarHeight}}px">
      <view class="sbar light">
        <text>邻里小助手</text>
        <text>参考值 · 非处方</text>
      </view>
      <view class="pgh-nav">
        <view class="pgh-bk" bindtap="goBack">‹</view>
        <text class="pgh-t">智慧配餐</text>
        <view class="pgh-rt" bindtap="onHelp">怎么算的</view>
      </view>
      <view class="pgh-k">
        <view class="pgh-ic"><view class="ic ic-m ic-bowl icw" /></view>
        <view class="pgh-km">
          <view class="pgh-lb">先告诉我你要吃成什么样</view>
          <view class="pgh-svc">按目标生成一周三餐</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="body">
      <view class="lblw"><view class="lbl">配餐目标 <text class="lbl-em">单选</text></view></view>
      <view class="ogrid">
        <view
          class="opt {{goalKey === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{goals}}"
          wx:key="key"
          data-v="{{item.key}}"
          bindtap="onPickGoal"
        >
          <view class="ok2">
            <view wx:if="{{goalKey === item.key}}" class="ic ic-s ic-check" />
          </view>
          <text class="opt-t">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="opt-d">{{item.desc}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="lblw"><view class="lbl">用餐人数</view></view>
      <view class="prow">
        <view
          class="dchip {{people === item.n ? 'on' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{peopleList}}"
          wx:key="n"
          data-v="{{item.n}}"
          bindtap="onPickPeople"
        >
          <text class="dc-t">{{item.n}} 人</text>
          <text class="dc-s">{{item.label}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="lblw"><view class="lbl">忌口 <text class="lbl-em">可多选</text></view></view>
      <view class="chips chipsw">
        <view
          class="chip {{item.on ? 'on' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{avoidList}}"
          wx:key="name"
          data-v="{{item.name}}"
          bindtap="onToggleAvoid"
        >{{item.name}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="tip">按《中国居民膳食指南》配比生成，热量为参考值；有慢性病请以签约医生意见为准。</view>
      <view class="pgtail" />
    </view>

    <view class="fbar">
      <view class="sum">
        <text class="sum-b">{{goalName}} · {{people}} 人份</text>
        <text class="sum-s">目标 {{goalKcal}} kcal / 日 · 钠 {{goalNa}} mg</text>
      </view>
      <view class="btn2" bindtap="onStart">生成一周配餐</view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <!-- 方案页 -->
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="pgh pgh--green" style="padding-top:{{statusBarHeight}}px">
      <view class="sbar light">
        <text>邻里小助手</text>
        <text>参考值 · 非处方</text>
      </view>
      <view class="pgh-nav">
        <view class="pgh-bk" bindtap="goBack">‹</view>
        <text class="pgh-t">智慧配餐</text>
        <view class="pgh-rt" bindtap="onResetGoal">改目标</view>
      </view>
      <view class="pgh-k">
        <view class="pgh-main">
          <view class="pgh-lb">今日能量 · {{goalName}}方案</view>
          <view class="pgh-num">{{sum.kcal}}<text class="num-u">/ {{goalKcal}} kcal</text></view>
        </view>
        <view class="pgh-side">
          <view class="pgh-lb">{{dayText}} · {{people}} 人份</view>
          <view class="pgh-lb">钠 {{sum.na}} / {{goalNa}} mg</view>
        </view>
        <view class="pgh-chip" bindtap="onOpenList">食材清单 ›</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="body">
      <!-- 营养达成 -->
      <view class="dash nut">
        <view class="nut-l">
          <text class="nut-p">{{percent}}%</text>
          <text class="nut-s">热量达成</text>
          <view class="bar nut-tr"><view class="bar-in" style="width:{{kcalBar}};background:#1FA97A" /></view>
        </view>
        <view class="nbl">
          <view class="nbr">
            <text class="nbr-k">蛋白</text>
            <view class="bar"><view class="bar-in" style="width:{{barP}};background:#1F5FD6" /></view>
            <text class="nbr-v">{{sum.p}} / {{targets.p}} g</text>
          </view>
          <view class="nbr">
            <text class="nbr-k">碳水</text>
            <view class="bar"><view class="bar-in" style="width:{{barC}};background:#F2A93B" /></view>
            <text class="nbr-v">{{sum.c}} / {{targets.c}} g</text>
          </view>
          <view class="nbr">
            <text class="nbr-k">脂肪</text>
            <view class="bar"><view class="bar-in" style="width:{{barF}};background:#C9302C" /></view>
            <text class="nbr-v">{{sum.f}} / {{targets.f}} g</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <!-- 一周切换 -->
      <view class="wkr">
        <view
          class="wkd {{day === index ? 'on' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{days}}"
          wx:key="*this"
          data-v="{{index}}"
          bindtap="onPickDay"
        >
          <text class="wk-t">{{item}}</text>
          <text class="wk-d">{{dayMeta[index]}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <!-- 三餐 -->
      <view class="dish" wx:for="{{slots}}" wx:key="slot">
        <view class="dhd">
          <text class="dt" style="background:{{item.color}}">{{item.label}}</text>
          <text class="dkc">{{item.kcal}} kcal · 蛋白 {{item.p}}g</text>
        </view>
        <view class="dbd">
          <view class="dim">{{item.emoji}}</view>
          <view class="dinfo">
            <view class="dnm">{{item.name}}</view>
            <view class="dnu">碳水 {{item.c}}g · 脂肪 {{item.f}}g · 钠 {{item.na}}mg</view>
            <view class="dtg">
              <text wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:for-item="tg" wx:key="*this">{{tg}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="dac">
          <view data-s="{{item.slot}}" bindtap="onSwap">
            <view class="ic ic-s ic-refresh" />
            <text>换一道</text>
          </view>
          <view class="{{item.locked ? 'on' : ''}}" data-s="{{item.slot}}" bindtap="onToggleLock">
            <view class="ic ic-s ic-{{item.locked ? 'lock' : 'unlock'}}" />
            <text>{{item.locked ? '已锁定' : '锁定'}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="meal-note">配餐依据《中国居民膳食指南（2022）》与目标人群能量需求估算。</view>
      <view class="meal-note">菜品可按忌口自动替换，仅供参考，不替代医生或营养师处方。</view>
      <view class="pgtail" />
    </view>

    <view class="fbar">
      <view class="sum">
        <text class="sum-b">{{people}} 人份 · {{goalName}}</text>
        <text class="sum-s">今日三餐 {{sum.kcal}} kcal</text>
      </view>
      <view class="btn2" bindtap="onOrder">预约助餐</view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <!-- 食材清单 -->
  <view wx:if="{{showList}}" class="mask" bindtap="onCloseList">
    <view class="sheet sheet--wx show" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="sht-h">今日食材清单</view>
      <view class="sht-tip">{{people}} 人份 · 共 {{listItems.length}} 项</view>
      <view class="ing" wx:for="{{listItems}}" wx:key="name">
        <text>{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="ing-n">×{{item.count}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="sht-ft">
        <view class="sht-btn2" bindtap="onCloseList">关闭</view>
        <view class="sht-btn2 sht-main" bindtap="onBuyIngredients">加入生鲜预订</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 预约助餐 -->
  <view wx:if="{{showOrder}}" class="mask" bindtap="onCloseOrder">
    <view class="sheet sheet--wx show" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="sht-h">预约助餐</view>
      <view class="sht-tip">提交后由社区食堂电话确认，餐费现场结算，不在本页收款。</view>
      <view class="slb">送餐时段</view>
      <view class="chips">
        <view
          class="chip {{orderTime === item ? 'on' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{times}}"
          wx:key="*this"
          data-v="{{item}}"
          bindtap="onPickTime"
        >{{item}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="slb">楼栋房号 <text class="req">必填</text></view>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="例：3 号楼 2 单元 502" maxlength="24" value="{{orderRoom}}" bindinput="onInputRoom" />
      <view class="slb">备注 <text class="opt-n">选填</text></view>
      <textarea
        class="ta"
        placeholder="例如：少盐、米饭软一点"
        maxlength="120"
        value="{{orderNote}}"
        bindinput="onInputNote"
      />
      <view class="sht-ft">
        <view class="sht-btn2" bindtap="onCloseOrder">取消</view>
        <view class="sht-btn2 sht-main" bindtap="onSubmitOrder">{{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交预约'}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 配餐口径说明 -->
  <view wx:if="{{showHelp}}" class="mask" bindtap="onCloseHelp">
    <view class="sheet sheet--wx show" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="sht-h">配餐怎么算的</view>
      <view class="sht-b">1. 能量按目标人群估算：控糖 1600、控压 1700、减脂 1400、术后 1800、老年软食 1500 kcal。</view>
      <view class="sht-b">2. 三大营养素按 蛋白 18% / 碳水 52% / 脂肪 30% 配比。</view>
      <view class="sht-b">3. 菜品优先匹配目标标签，再按忌口过滤；钠上限按目标 1300-1800mg。</view>
      <view class="sht-b sht-warn">以上为膳食建议，不替代医生或营养师处方；糖尿病、肾病、术后患者请遵医嘱。</view>
      <view class="sht-btn" bindtap="onCloseHelp">知道了</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
